 <section id="imports" class="fitness-card fitness-controls" aria-labelledby="fitness-import-title"><h2 id="fitness-import-title">Samsung Health, Google Fit & Android Health Connect</h2><p>Health Connect access is granted on your Android phone. Use the companion to read selected workout summaries, save its CSV and review that file here. This transfer is user initiated; it is not a background web connection.</p><ol><li>In Samsung Health or Google Fit, enable the activity types you want to share with Health Connect.</li><li>Install the test companion, review its read permissions and export the selected period and source app.</li><li>Upload the CSV here, inspect the preview and confirm. Merge imports to retain earlier months, or choose a reviewed replacement. Merge does not infer deletions of absent source records; delete the copy or replace it when needed.</li></ol><p><a href="https://github.com/Goblis-Foundation/Waithaka-Ndegwa/actions/workflows/health-companion.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Android companion test builds →</a> · <a href="<?=url('/write/activity/template')?>">Download CSV template</a></p><p class="muted">Test builds require manual installation and device permission checks. A 365-day export also requires optional history permission on a supported device; otherwise use 7/30 days and earlier reviewed imports. The app has no internet permission and does not upload data automatically. A Samsung or Google login in this website cannot read Health Connect.</p>
